From: Christian Leithner <christian_leithner@comcast.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Jan 2026 18:06:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Yocto: Bootstrap venv pip and upgrade setuptools

Yocto Kirkstone provides setuptools 59.5.0, but chip-mobly requires
setuptools>=64.0.0 for editable_wheel build backend support.

Bootstrap pip using ensurepip in the virtualenv, avoiding the mixed native
sysroot pip package tree, then upgrade setuptools to a version that supports editable_wheel while
retaining pkg_resources, which Pigweed's environment check still imports.

Generated by Copilot AI
Signed-off-by: Christian Leithner <christian_leithner@comcast.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]

---
 .../pw_env_setup/virtualenv_setup/install.py  | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pw_env_setup/py/pw_env_setup/virtualenv_setup/install.py b/pw_env_setup/py/pw_env_setup/virtualenv_setup/install.py
index e69392a..9582505 100644
--- a/pw_env_setup/py/pw_env_setup/virtualenv_setup/install.py
+++ b/pw_env_setup/py/pw_env_setup/virtualenv_setup/install.py
@@ -386,2 +386,20 @@ def install(  # pylint: disable=too-many-arguments,too-many-locals,too-many-stat
             raise RuntimeError('YOCTO BUILD: pip not found in host Python paths')
+
+        # Bootstrap pip in the venv and upgrade setuptools for editable_wheel.
+        import subprocess
+        venv_site_packages = os.path.join(venv_path, 'lib', f'python{sys.version_info.major}.{sys.version_info.minor}', 'site-packages')
+        venv_pip_path = os.path.join(venv_site_packages, 'pip')
+        if os.path.islink(venv_pip_path):
+            os.unlink(venv_pip_path)
+        venv_python = os.path.join(venv_path, 'bin', 'python')
+        subprocess.run(
+            [venv_python, '-m', 'ensurepip', '--upgrade', '--default-pip'],
+            env={**os.environ, 'PYTHONPATH': ''},
+            check=True,
+        )
+        subprocess.run(
+            [venv_python, '-m', 'pip', 'install', '--upgrade', 'setuptools>=68.0.0,<82'],
+            env={**os.environ, 'PYTHONPATH': ''},
+            check=True,
+        )
     # TODO(tonymd): Remove this when projects have defined requirements.
     if (not requirements) and constraints:
         requirements = constraints
